# .trufflehogignore -- exclude patterns for TruffleHog secret detection
# Each line is a regex matched against file paths. Do NOT anchor with ^ --
# TruffleHog matches against the absolute path, so an anchored pattern never
# fires. Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are ignored.
#
# Committed *.example templates are deliberately NOT listed -- they must stay
# scanned so a real credential pasted into one is caught. Nothing under app/
# other than the binary animation blobs is excluded: source-file hits are
# triage, not noise.

# Local, untracked env and auth fixtures
\.env$
cypress\.env\.json$
e2e/\.auth/
playwright/\.auth/

# Editor and agent config
\.claude/
\.vscode/
\.idea/
\.history/

# Vendored, generated and build output
node_modules/
/build/
/coverage/
\.tmp-webpack/
package-lock\.json$
patches/
public/

# Lottie animation exports -- base64 image blobs that trip entropy detectors
app/assets/animations/

# Scan output
htd-cq-output/
\.htd-cq-coverage/

# Stray archive committed at the repository root
github\.zip$
